{"data": {"Page": {"pageInfo": {"currentPage": 15, "hasNextPage": true}, "media": [{"id": 126658, "title": {"romaji": "TIME ON THE PLANET", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "The sun rises in one place and the sun sets in another.<br>\nWhen a woman's hair grows up, a man shaves off her elongated beard.<br>\nEven if the time is different, the time passes in the same way anywhere.<br>\nThe earth turns and the sun rises again.\n<br><br>\nEach of the frames has a structure that loops indefinitely.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official website)", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 126667, "title": {"romaji": "Blue Star", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for the track <i>Blue Star</i> by HachiojiP featuring Miku Hatsune from the album \"Eight: The Best of HachiojiP\". The song is the theme song of Hatsune Miku Expo 2016.\n<br><br>\nThere are two official videos for this song, one is the official music video for Hatsune Miku Expo 2016, with illustrations by Kei Moshizuki and direction by Okiku, released on February 15, 2016.<br><br>\nThe other is directed by Atsushi Wakamura and is the one included with the first press release of  HachiojiP's eighth album \"Eight: The Best of HachiojiP\" on June 15, 2016.", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 2, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Vocal Synth", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Dancing", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 127099, "title": {"romaji": "Wu Shan Wu Xing", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 12}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 128020, "title": {"romaji": "Norman the Snowman: Nagareboshi no Furu Yoru ni", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Norman and the boy decide to go on an adventure to see the stars filling the sky as shooting stars will reach the town soon. What they don’t know is it will get too cloudy to see anything up there. It’s about their small and yet heartwarming journey.", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2016, "episodes": 1, "duration": 25, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#ノーマンザスノーマン", "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Stop Motion", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 128951, "title": {"romaji": "39 Music!", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Official music video for the event Magical Mirai 2016, with art by Mago and music by Mikito-P, performed by Miku Hatsune.", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Music"], "tags": [{"name": "Chibi", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Musical Theater", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Idol", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Vocal Synth", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Gambling", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 129175, "title": {"romaji": "Jijia Shou Shen: Baolie Feiche", "english": null}, "format": "TV", "description": "Bang! One day, the Universe exploded! The explosion produced a number of light crystals that scattered in the Earth and became energy coins. Some energy life entities also came to the Earth and existed as mini cars to chase light crystals. Once those mini cars grasped light crystals, they would return to their original forms. A group of evil attempted to plot against the Earth with the superpower of light crystals. To protect the Earth, the righteous kids Hawley, Kinson and Yolan help the mini cars of the justice side to collect energy coins. Armed with Eagle Car and Dragon Car, the two brothers are ready to fight against the Commander-K leaded evil force. The war is on…\n<br><br>\n(Source: YouTube)", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 40, "duration": 23, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Mecha"], "tags": [{"name": "CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 129219, "title": {"romaji": "Tai Yi Xian Mo Lu: Ling Fei Ji", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 10}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 26, "duration": 15, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cultivation", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 129328, "title": {"romaji": "A Beojiuibang", "english": "My Father’s Room"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "She was abused by her father during childhood. Since he left, the pain and anger had begun to fade. One day, unexpectedly, she was struck by a revelation about her father's life that cast her feelings about him into confusion.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Vimeo)", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 9, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sl